  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/00_logo.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"680\" height=\"242\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Pyrotech — это мод для ранней стадии игры, включающий новые примитивные устройства, машины для сгорания, механики плавки, варианты хранения, инструменты, факелы, достижения и абсолютно никакого графического интерфейса — за исключением существенно полного, в основном иллюстрированного и обугленного руководства.</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Обязательные зависимости: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/athenaeum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Athenaeum</a>, <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dropt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dropt</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Дополнительные зависимости: <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a>*, <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>, <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/crafttweaker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker</a>, <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hwyla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HWYLA</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">* Patchouli необходим для использования руководства.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Ссылки: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpyrotech.readthedocs.io%252fen%252flatest%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Справочник по ZenScript</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/01_00_earlyGame.png\" alt=\"earlyGame\" width=\"680\" height=\"94\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/01_01_torches-01.png\" alt=\"факелы\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/01_02_campfire.png\" alt=\"костёр\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/01_03_roastFoods.png\" alt=\"жареные продукты\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/02_00_gatherStore.png\" alt=\"собирать и хранить\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/02_01_crudeTools.png\" alt=\"грубые инструменты\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/02_02_flintTools.png\" alt=\"кремнёвые инструменты\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/02_03_boneTools.png\" alt=\"инструменты из костей\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/02_04_rockBag.png\" alt=\"сумка для камней\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/02_05_shelves.png\" alt=\"полки\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/02_06_buckets-01.png\" alt=\"ведра\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/03_00_craftMechanize.png\" alt=\"механизировать крафт\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/03_01_craftng.png\" alt=\"кузница\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/03_02_soakingPot.png\" alt=\"soakingPot\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/03_03-04_compactor-machines-01.png\" alt=\"compactor-machines\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/03_05_bellows.png\" alt=\"bellows\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/03_06_cogs.png\" alt=\"cogs\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/04_00_fuel.png\" alt=\"fuel\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/04_01_pitKiln.png\" alt=\"pitKiln\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/04_02_pitBurn.png\" alt=\"pitBurn\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/04_03_fuels.png\" alt=\"fuels\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/04_04_bowDrill.png\" alt=\"bowDrill\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/04_05_refractory.png\" alt=\"refractory\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/05_00_bloomery.png\" alt=\"bloomery\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/05_01_bloomery.png\" alt=\"bloomery\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/05_02_bloom.gif\" alt=\"бум\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/05_03_tongs.png\" alt=\"щипцы\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/06_00-01_nether.png\" alt=\"ад»\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/06_02_obsidian.png\" alt=\"обсидиан\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/06_03_livingTar.png\" alt=\"живой дёготь\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/07_00_meta.png\" alt=\"мета\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/07_01_advancements.png\" alt=\"достижения\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/07_02_guide.png\" alt=\"руководство\" width=\"680\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codetaylor/pyrotech/master/assets/curse/07_03_configs.png\" alt=\"конфигурации\" width=\"680\"></p>",
